          "$\\dfrac{2}{7} = \\dfrac{2 \\times 5}{7 \\times 5} = \\dfrac{10}{35}$ .",
          "$A = \\dfrac{56 - 10}{35} = \\dfrac{46}{35}$ ."
        ],
        "result": "A = \\dfrac{46}{35}"
